# Names only, never values. The real values live in Vercel: project "emotes" -> Settings -> Environment Variables.
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development (.env.local is git-ignored). Without a key, analytics is simply off.

# PostHog public project token (phc_...). It is safe in the browser; it can only send events, never read them.
VITE_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
# Always /ingest: the site proxies analytics through its own origin (vercel.json rewrites).
VITE_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=/ingest
